# The launcher's pop-up cast (port/settings/launcher_popup.cpp): Mario and his partners, who spring up
# on the stage's front edge as the launcher opens. The game's own faces as they are: Mario's head
# (ICON_19E, the pause menu's Mario page) and the partners' (ICON_155 to ICON_161, the party page's
# list, win_party.c's winPartyDt). Made at the first start, like every recipe; the launcher reads them
# back from the art cache (<user>/art_cache/<game id>/art/launcher/), so the cast shows from the
# start after the game first ran on that disc, and the pop-up plays without it before.

image art/launcher/mario.png
  load icon ICON_19E
end

image art/launcher/goombella.png
  load icon ICON_155
end

image art/launcher/koops.png
  load icon ICON_156
end

image art/launcher/bobbery.png
  load icon ICON_157
end

image art/launcher/yoshi.png
  load icon ICON_158
end

image art/launcher/flurrie.png
  load icon ICON_15F
end

image art/launcher/vivian.png
  load icon ICON_160
end

image art/launcher/mowz.png
  load icon ICON_161
end
